  :335-338 authenticated receives ONLY: USAGE on ttb_api + EXECUTE on EXACTLY the seven
          RPCs (session_context, membership_context, evidence_insert, evidence_read,
          spend_reserve, spend_claim, spend_complete) ✅ matches adapter's RPC table.
